--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/5256.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Fixed the assertion rewriting message for byte strings: comparing two ``bytes``
+objects now shows a readable diff of their ``repr()`` instead of treating them
+as sequences and reporting confusing integer "items" (the byte ordinals).
